<?php if(isset($_SESSION['flash'])): ?><div class="flash <?= e($_SESSION['flash']['type']) ?>" role="status"><?= e($_SESSION['flash']['message']) ?></div><?php unset($_SESSION['flash']); endif; ?><?php if(!empty($_SESSION['errors'])): ?><div class="flash error" role="alert"><?php foreach($_SESSION['errors'] as $error): ?><p><?= e($error) ?></p><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endif; ?>
